### Zintis LED Plugin API Test
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090
@pluginId = zintis-led-plugin
@pluginApiPrefix = /plugin/{{pluginId}}/api

### ========== 0. 基础检查 ==========

### 0.1 Health
GET {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/health


### ========== 1. 直连设备控制（非 TCP 模式） ==========
# 数据命令参考：
# 项目        十六进制   十进制
# 控制口_1    0xF5      245
# 控制口_2    0xCA      202
# 控制口_3    0x3A      58
# 控制口_4    0xA5      165
# 控制口_5    0x23      35
# 控制口_6    0xBA      186
# 控制口_ALL  0x9C      156

### 1.1 Turn on (0x35)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/control/on
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 186,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 1.2 Turn off (0xFA)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/control/off
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 186,
  "timeoutMs": 10000
}

### 1.3 Pulse (0x36)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/control/pulse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 186,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 1.4 Query status (0xAB)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/control/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 245,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 1.5 Query system info
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/system/info
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 207,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 1.6 Query signal strength
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/system/signal-strength
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "timeoutMs": 6000
}

### 1.7 Query system network (MAC + IP)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/system/network
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "dataCommand": 207,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}


### ========== 2. 设备 TCP 模式配置（指令下发） ==========
# 说明：本组是对 LED 设备下发“开启/关闭 TCP server/client 模式”指令，
# 不等同于本服务自身的 Netty Server 管理。

### 2.1 Open device TCP server (0xBF + 0x23)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/tcp/server/open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 2.2 Close device TCP server (0xBF + 0x2E)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/tcp/server/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 2.3 Open device TCP client (0xBF + 0x33)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/tcp/client/open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "targetIp": "192.168.2.180",
  "targetPort": 9834,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}

### 2.4 Close device TCP client (0xBF + 0x3E)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/tcp/client/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIp": "192.168.2.102",
  "devicePort": 9527,
  "hostAddress": 102,
  "timeoutMs": 3000
}


### ========== 3. Netty Server 管理（本服务） ==========

### 3.1 Netty server status
GET {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/status

### 3.2 Netty server start (default 9834)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/start
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3.3 Netty server stop
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/stop

### 3.4 Netty active clients list
GET {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/clients


### ========== 4. Netty 下行发送（本服务 -> 已连接客户端） ==========
# remoteAddress 可先通过 {{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/clients 获取

### 4.1 Send to one client (ASCII payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remoteAddress": "192.168.2.102:52314",
  "payload": "PING_FROM_SERVER",
  "payloadFormat": "ascii"
}

### 4.2 Send to one client (HEX payload, 0x 前缀格式)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remoteAddress": "192.168.2.102:53373",
  "payload": "0x66 0x35 0xBA 0x3C 0x07",
  "payloadFormat": "hex",
  "waitResponse": true
}

### 4.3 Send to one client (HEX payload, plain hex string)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remoteAddress": "192.168.2.102:53373",
  "payload": "66 35 BA 3C 07",
  "payloadFormat": "hex"
}

### 4.4 Send to one client (numeric array payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remoteAddress": "192.168.2.102:56948",
  "payloadArray": [102, 53, 186, 60, 7],
  "payloadFormat": "hex"
}

### 4.5 Send to one client (Turn off payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remoteAddress": "192.168.2.102:53373",
  "payload": "0x66 0xFA 0xBA 0xCC 0x52",
  "payloadFormat": "hex",
  "waitResponse": true
}

### 4.6 Broadcast (ASCII payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": "BROADCAST_FROM_SERVER",
  "payloadFormat": "ascii"
}

### 4.7 Broadcast (HEX payload, plain hex string)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": "66 AB 97 11 0D 33 41 3A 36 39 3A 37 41 3A 30 38 3A 44 30 3A 41 35 31 39 32 2E 31 36 38 2E 32 2E 31 30 32 90 78",
  "payloadFormat": "hex"
}

### 4.8 Broadcast (numeric array payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{pluginApiPrefix}}/netty/server/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadArray": [102, 53, 186, 60, 7],
  "payloadFormat": "hex"
}
